    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d747">

                <pb facs="0775" n="517" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg517"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 841.857Ar1/1</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Consul at Cork</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Frost</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-08-21">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 21, 1915</hi>.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Report by telegraph brief summary of affidavits in <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Arabic</hi> case, covering particularly question of warning, ramming,
                    convoy, and whether <hi rendition="#italic">Arabic</hi> was going to assistance
                    of <hi rendition="#italic">Dunsley</hi>.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
